{"surah":70,"ayahs":["سَأَلَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">سَآ</span>ئِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-iqlab\">لُۢ بِ</span>عَذَا<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">بٍ وَ</span>اقِعٍ","لِّلْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">كَٰ</span>فِرِينَ لَيْسَ لَهُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> دَافِعٌ","مِّنَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ ذِى <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَعَارِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">جِ</span>","تَعْرُجُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">لَٰٓ</span>ئِكَةُ وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>رُّوحُ إِلَيْهِ فِى يَوْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">مٍ كَ</span>انَ مِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">قْ</span>دَارُهُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> خَمْسِينَ أَلْفَ سَنَةٍ","فَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>صْبِرْ صَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">بْ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">رًا جَ</span>مِيلاً","إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>هُمْ يَرَوْنَهُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> بَعِيدًا","وَنَرَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ٮٰ</span>هُ قَرِيبًا","يَوْمَ تَكُونُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">مَآ</span>ءُ كَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمُهْلِ","وَتَكُونُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْجِبَالُ كَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعِهْنِ","وَلَا يَسْــَٔلُ حَمِيمٌ حَمِيمًا","يُبَصَّرُونَهُمْ‌ۚ يَوَدُّ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">جْ</span>رِمُ لَوْ يَفْتَدِى مِنْ عَذَابِ يَوْمِئِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-iqlab\">ذِۭ بِ</span>بَ<s