-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَا<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">دُو</span>نَ","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ هُمْ لِأَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">مَٰنَٰ</span>تِهِمْ وَعَهْدِهِمْ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">رَٰ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">عُو</span>نَ","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa_shafawi\">هُم بِ</span>شَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">هَٰدَٰ</span>تِهِمْ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">قَآ</span>ئِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">مُو</span>نَ","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ هُمْ عَلَىٰ صَلَاتِهِمْ يُحَافِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">ظُو</span>نَ","أُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">وْ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">لَٰٓ</span>ئِكَ فِى جَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">نَّٰ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">تٍ مُّ</span>كْرَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">مُو</span>نَ","فَمَالِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ كَفَرُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> قِبَلَكَ مُهْطِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">عِي</span>نَ","عَنِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْيَمِينِ وَعَنِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>شِّمَالِ عِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">زِي</span>نَ","أَيَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">طْ</span>مَعُ كُلُّ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>مْرِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">ىٍٕ مِّ</span>نْهُمْ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">أَن يُ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span>خَلَ جَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>ةَ نَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">عِي</span>مٍ